&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4633&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with policy-as-code and turning standards into enforced controls.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4720&quot;&gt;Contributions to security standards, frameworks, or industry practice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
